%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: A_UnMois
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'Pas avant un mois. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "On n'aura rien de plus sur la victime alors \u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je vois. De mon c\xF4t\xE9, j\u2019ai pu acc\xE9der \xE0 la sc\xE8ne de
      crime. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21b87153fb3e5f94c809d9a129d0e1ee, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Heureusement que tu n\u2019es pas venu. Je pense que je t\u2019aurais
      retrouv\xE9 par terre en quelques secondes\u202F!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Mais tr\xEAve de blagues, comme tu le sais la victime a \xE9t\xE9 tu\xE9e
      dans le bureau de Monsieur Warner. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "La pi\xE8ce en elle-m\xEAme n\u2019avait rien de tr\xE8s sp\xE9cial mis
      \xE0 part que le bureau \xE9tait sens dessus dessous. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Ce n\u2019est pas normal, je sais tr\xE8s bien que Monsieur Warner est
      un grand maniaque."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: " Il y a peut-\xEAtre eu une lutte entre le meurtrier et la victime, ou
      alors la pi\xE8ce a \xE9t\xE9 fouill\xE9e."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "La victime a \xE9t\xE9 retrouv\xE9e sur le dos et serait morte de plusieurs
      coups \xE0 l\u2019arri\xE8re du cr\xE2ne. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Tu as pu mettre la main sur l\u2019arme du crime ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je pense que oui, jettes-y un coup d\u2019\u0153il.  "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 422d2131e896603498fc65c811e19688, type: 2}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "(Sa base est compl\xE8tement d\xE9form\xE9e sans oublier les t\xE2ches
      dessus \u2026 Je pense qu\u2019on a bien l\u2019arme du crime.))"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "J\u2019y pense, qu\u2019en est-il de Monsieur Warner ? Tu as pu l\u2019interroger\u202F? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21b87153fb3e5f94c809d9a129d0e1ee, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "J\u2019ai pris sa d\xE9position, il m\u2019a expliqu\xE9 qu\u2019il avait
      organis\xE9 une interview avec la victime dans son bureau. Il m\u2019a dit
      que c\u2019\xE9tait vers \u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 899c5b9aef409eb4da395486bb786ab3, type: 2}
  conditionScene: {fileID: 0}
  conditionToUnlock: []
